s8-6-p6 : Block
s8-6-p6 = prose (cons "An elaborated Clang AST is useful because many choices are explicit there. If Clang supplies those choices, its use is a declared frontend assumption unless its output is independently validated against the source semantics or the relevant frontend implementation has the required connection. Running a lifted Clang preserves what that Clang does; it does not alone establish standard conformance. Source mapping is retained so that properties and transformations attach to the actual declarations and expressions." nil)
